{'symbol': 'QCOM', 'date': '2021-10-12 16:30:00', 'title': 'QUALCOMM ANNOUNCES NEW $10.0 BILLION STOCK REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION', 'text': "SAN DIEGO, OCT. 12, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0QUALCOMM INCORPORATED (NASDAQ: QCOM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPROVED, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY, A NEW $10.0 BILLION STOCK REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION.\xa0THE NEW STOCK REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION IS IN ADDITION TO THE COMPANY'S STOCK REPURCHASE PROGRAM ANNOUNCED IN JULY 2018, WHICH HAS $0.9 BILLION OF REPURCHASE AUTHORITY REMAINING."}